install vscode for windows

1. install python extension
Settings -> Extensions -> install python extension

2. in the wsl project root
mkdir .vscode
vim .vscode/settings.json
{
  "python.defaultInterpreterPath": "/home/your_username/your_project/venv/bin/python"
}

3. connect wsl project
Settings -> Command Palette -> choose WSL: connect to WSl, connect to the project in wsl
